{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:aef23b2f2efb6564","name":"Adascorp","source":{"id":"source:reference-aef23b2f2efb6564","title":"Adascorp","revision":15703,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:03Z","sha256":"d1c4f924f2cc37caf396959920907cd4d89eb11782cbc2cd03a2a1a07d3d214e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15703","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Adascorp&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-aef23b2f2efb6564","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Officially known as the Adasca BioMechanical Corporation of Arkania, Adascorp is one of the largest ",{"tag":"a","children":["Arkanian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arkanian","referenceId":"reference:196fbd4dd2f10672"}," corporate dynasties. It is also the galaxy's largest bioengineering firm. It is owned by the House of Adasca and operated by current lord of the house, Lord ",{"tag":"a","children":["Arkoh Adasca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arkoh_Adasca","referenceId":"reference:3d74023059294ca1"},". Although the Lord of Adasca is not the ruler of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Arkania"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arkania","referenceId":"reference:b03722d43a42e075"},", outsiders are forgiven for assuming that is the case, given the extent of Adascorp's influence over the population.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Adascorp is famous for bioengineering and medical research advances. It is responsible for providing the galaxy with thousands of treatments and advancing medical knowledge at a tremendous pace. However, not all it's pursuits are as noble as some would hope. Some schemes are driven by pure economics, to enrich the corporation and expand its reach. Much of the galaxy would also be shocked to learn of Adascorp's persecution of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Arkanian Offshoots"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arkanian_Offshoots"}," and its promotion of pure-blooded ",{"tag":"a","children":["Arkanians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arkanians"}," as a superior ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For years, Adascorp headquarters is located on the massive Starship ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Arkanian Legacy"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Arkanian_Legacy","referenceId":"reference:53ae572571adc054"},". However, the great ship is lost along with Lord ",{"tag":"a","children":["Arkoh Adasca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arkoh_Adasca","referenceId":"reference:3d74023059294ca1"}," in his ill-fated attempt to secure galactic power through Operation Dark Harvest. Arkoh's scheme is to militarize massive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exogorths"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exogorths?action=edit&redlink=1"}," to enable them to decimate entire star systems. He tries to sell them in a bidding war between ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorians","referenceId":"reference:b7f4f8a44de3a6c8"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},". Unfortunately for Arkoh, the scheme falls apart when his lead researcher turns the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exogorths"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exogorths?action=edit&redlink=1"}," against ",{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Arkanian Legacy"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Arkanian_Legacy","referenceId":"reference:53ae572571adc054"},". The loss of the ship and its extensive archives and research facilities sets Adascorp research back by decades. Worse, with no explicit heir to Arkoh's controlling interest in the corporation, ownership remains contested and is unlikely to be settled for years. The situation is complicated by the fact that the Republic continues to conceal the events around Operation Dark Harvest, seeking to protect its own interests with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Arkanians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arkanians"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Adascorp Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["HK-24 Assassin Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/HK-24_Assassin_Droid","referenceId":"reference:d0184e32f317df16"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 7\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Arkoh Adasca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arkoh_Adasca","referenceId":"reference:3d74023059294ca1"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 13\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Vehicles"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TYPE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["IMAGE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Arkanian Legacy"]}],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Arkanian_Legacy","referenceId":"reference:53ae572571adc054"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
